ves the baseline unchanged.\n\n## Approach\n\nNormalize and serialize stable return annotations with an explicit unannotated sentinel, regenerate the baseline, and add a held-out return-only drift case. Keep cross-Python normalization deterministic and do not expand beyond the documented public surface.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `scripts/gen_api_surface.py`\n- `tests/unit/api_surface_baseline.json`\n- API-surface gate tests and public-types contract tests\n\n## Testing\n\nCover annotated return change, unannotated sentinel, nested/typing normalization, and a parameter-identical return-only held-out drift case.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Every recorded public callable serializes a stable normalized return annotation or explicit unannotated sentinel.\n- [ ] Existing parameter serialization and baseline entries remain compatible except for deliberate return fields.\n- [ ] A return-only public API change fails the held-out drift test.\n- [ ] Baseline generation is deterministic on supported Python versions and focused API checks pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"scripts/gen_api_surface.py","reason":"serialize normalized return annotations"},{"path":"tests/unit/api_surface_baseline.json","reason":"regenerate baseline with return contract"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_api_surface_gate.py","reason":"prove return-only drift is detected"},{"path":"tests/interfaces/contracts/test_public_types.py","reason":"preserve stable public typing contract"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["janitor","api","oracle","rp29"],"ticket_id":"8e5c-5c73-d540-41db","ticket_type":"story","title":"Include return annotations in public API surface snapshots","verify_commands":[]}